{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runehaven is an atmospheric first-person dungeon crawler with roguelike elements taking place in a destructible voxel world. Combine runes to craft your own unique spells or to enchant weapons, alter the environment, explore procedurally generated dungeons, battle vile creatures, solve puzzles, discover hidden secrets, and dodge deadly traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/runic_magic_header.png?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/runic_magic.gif?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your own spells by combining different runes using a magic system inspired by Ultima and Arx Fatalis! Each rune affects the spell in an unique and emergent way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/voxel_physics_header.png?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/voxel_physics_3.gif?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fully destructible voxel environment. Nearly everything in the game can be destroyed, either by the player or the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A complex spell crafting system where you combine runes to create spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enchant melee and ranged weapons using runes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voxel physics with a fully destructible voxel environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural dungeons where every map layout is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between various melee, ranged and magic weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dual wielding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge deadly traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Voxel graphics with physically based rendering.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve various puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fight against different monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Level up your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Modding support.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676030?t=1743080433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743080433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/21b4a6295f23e5c39afeafcc9117b0defe18cd0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743080433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/21b4a6295f23e5c39afeafcc9117b0defe18cd0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743080433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2918260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runehaven is an atmospheric first-person dungeon crawler with roguelike elements taking place in a destructible voxel world. Combine runes to craft your own unique spells or to enchant weapons, alter the environment, explore procedurally generated dungeons, battle vile creatures, solve puzzles, discover hidden secrets, and dodge deadly traps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/runic_magic_header.png?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/runic_magic.gif?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your own spells by combining different runes using a magic system inspired by Ultima and Arx Fatalis! Each rune affects the spell in an unique and emergent way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/voxel_physics_header.png?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/extras/voxel_physics_3.gif?t=1743080433\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a fully destructible voxel environment. Nearly everything in the game can be destroyed, either by the player or the enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A complex spell crafting system where you combine runes to create spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enchant melee and ranged weapons using runes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voxel physics with a fully destructible voxel environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural dungeons where every map layout is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between various melee, ranged and magic weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dual wielding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge deadly traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Voxel graphics with physically based rendering.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore unique biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve various puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fight against different monsters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discover secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Level up your character. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Modding support.  </p></li></ul>","developers":["Cikoria Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676030/header.jpg?t=1743080433","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101960,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101960/movie480.mp4?t=1740421881","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101960/movie_max.mp4?t=1740421881"},"name":"Runehaven trailer 0.8.4","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101960/e61f9662ef70b539fea88eb9d8e1330d1a1b6570/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740421881","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101960/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740421881","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101960/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740421881"}}],"name":"Runehaven","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 2.8 GHz / AMD FX-6300, 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 760, (2 GB VRAM) | AMD Radeon HD 7870, (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 | AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br